---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EmailLink from '../components/EmailLink.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy — ${site.title}`}
  description="Privacy information for rowlandekemezie.com, including analytics, newsletter subscriptions, and public machine-readable resources."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-stack">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This is a personal website and technical publication. It collects only the data needed to
        operate the site, understand basic usage, and deliver requested subscriptions.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate traffic and site
        performance. It does not set cookies or track you across other sites, and there is no Google
        Analytics or advertising script on this site. Newsletter signup is handled through Kit when
        you choose to subscribe, which means the email address you submit is sent to that service so
        it can send a confirmation email and manage the subscription. You are only subscribed after
        you confirm. I do not ask these services to build advertising profiles for this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        Reading progress (which essays you have started or finished) is stored only in your
        browser's local storage. It never leaves your device, and you can clear it with the Reset
        button on the homepage or by clearing site data in your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        Standard web infrastructure can process technical request data such as an IP address,
        browser or user-agent string, requested URL, timestamps, and security signals. Cloudflare or
        another hosting layer may use that information to deliver content, cache responses, prevent
        abuse, and keep the site available. Public resources such as articles, RSS, sitemap data,
        llms.txt, OpenAPI documents, structured data, and the public profile API are intentionally
        available to browsers, search engines, and automated agents.
      </p>
      <p>
        I do not sell personal information. If you subscribe, you can use the unsubscribe mechanism
        in a newsletter message. For a privacy question about data controlled directly through this
        site, <EmailLink title="Email Rowland">contact me by email</EmailLink> and identify the relevant
        interaction so I can understand the request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
